            <div class="title">
                <h2 class="feature-title">Work For VLR!</h2>
                <p>VLR, Vancouver's foremost Luxury Real Estate Company. 
                By being selected to join the Vancouver Luxury Realty team, 
                you enter the world of the most exclusive real estate in Canada, 
                top tier VIP tenants and highly esteemed real estate investors. 
                If you enjoy working with luxury products and services and have an 
                excellent understanding of the needs and wants of VIP clients, 
                then we invite you to submit your application today. Our boutique office offers a professional, 
                friendly, supportive and outwardly competitive atmosphere where hard work is noticed and talented 
                agents are always appreciated. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="title">
                <h2 class="feature-title">Current Open Positions</h2>
                <p>You may forward your PDF format application with resume and a cover letter in response to any posting shown
                    below to:<a href="mailto:info@vancouverluxuryrealty.com"> info@vancouverluxuryrealty.com</a>. Please
                    note that resumes without a cover letter will not be considered. Only those candidates selected for an
                    interview will be contacted.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="detail">
                <hr class="hr-with-dot margin-top-100">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <h3 class="panel-title bold-h3">
                        Licensed Leasing Agent
                    </h3>
                    <div id="collapseSpecial" class="panel-collapse feature-list">
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <p>Leasing Agents duties include creating and maintaining long lasting 
                                relationships with new and current owners as well as with tenants. 
                                While the VLR brand and office offer multiple business opportunities and leads, 
                                you will also be required to conduct quality business development outside the existing 
                                networks, source new opportunities and promote and maintain the excellence of the brand. 
                                Signing new owner accounts, conducting showings, receiving and reviewing applications along 
                                with signing of leases are some of specific duties of a Leasing Specialist.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <p>This contract position is 100% commission based with a guaranteed potential to earn 50K 
                                plus by using our platform which has the biggest reward potential in the city as demonstrated 
                                with our existing Leasing Agents who routinely exceed the 100K/year mark.</p>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                <p>Requirements for this position include Property Manager license (RECBC), prior real 
                                estate or sales experience, strong inter-personal and communication skills in the English 
                                language, good knowledge of Vancouver and a vehicle. We thank all applicants for taking their 
                                time and applying, however only those selected for an interview will be contacted.</p>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
